MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Remove the 'Made by Nemesis' sidebar section (deliverables already live in the
  Exports/ folder tree and open in-app there). Kills the redundant floating list the
  owner objected to twice AND the openArtifactHref path that opened nothing on this page.
- Tabs: add 'relative z-10 [-webkit-app-region:no-drag]' to the tab bar so it sits above
  the titlebar drag band — real mouse clicks now switch tabs (the chat rail already did
  this; Library's bar didn't, so macOS ate the clicks as window-drags).
- Links in a note (wikilinks, rail backlinks, back/forward) navigate IN PLACE — swap the
  active tab's content via openInPlace instead of spawning a new tab. Sidebar still opens tabs.
- Remove the 'Saved to disk' pill (subtle 'Saving…' only while writing).
- FilePreview: only offer 'Open in default app' for formats we can't render in-app
  (PowerPoint/Word); PDF/HTML/images stay inside Nemesis.
